---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Midnight Manga Vault"
	description="Meet the curator behind Midnight Manga Vault (Manga Sommelier): 30+ years of reading Japanese manga classics, narrative analysis, and verified edition buyer guides."
	pubDate={new Date('August 19 2026')}
>
	<div class="profile-container">
		<section class="profile-hero">
			<div class="profile-image-box">
				<img src="/images/profile-manga.jpg" alt="Japanese Manga and Anime Bookshelf Collection" class="hero-img" />
				<span class="img-caption">A glimpse into our curated collection of cherished Japanese manga, light novels, and anime media.</span>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="profile-content">
			<h2>Welcome to Midnight Manga Vault — Curated by Manga Sommelier</h2>
			<p>
				Thank you for visiting <strong>Midnight Manga Vault</strong>.<br />
				This archive is maintained by <strong>Manga Sommelier</strong>, a lifelong Japanese manga reader with over 30 years of reading across classic shonen, dark psychological seinen, and sci-fi epics. Whether you are looking for overlooked 90s gems or collector editions worth importing, every guide pairs personal reading appreciation with verified edition specifications for international readers.
			</p>

			<h3>Our Origin: Growing Up with Japanese Manga</h3>
			<p>
				Ever since early childhood, manga has been an essential part of my life. Reading classic titles like <em>Doraemon</em> (the series that first taught me kanji) and legendary shonen works such as <em>Dragon Ball</em> hundreds of times—alongside being stunned as a teenager by Ryu Fujisaki's short-story craftsmanship—sparked both a lifelong love of imaginative Sci-Fi/Fantasy world-building and a deep appreciation for Japanese visual literature.
			</p>
			<p>
				Over the decades, reading hundreds of series across various genres—from pulse-pounding action and dark psychological suspense to intricate sci-fi—has taught us that the most impactful stories are those that stand the test of time. While digital chapters make exploring new series convenient, the favorites I genuinely love and intend to reread for years always earn a dedicated spot in complete physical volumes on my shelf.
			</p>

			<h3>Editorial Standards & Philosophy</h3>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Literary &amp; Edition-Level Research</strong>: We combine story and character analysis with verified publisher specifications, format comparisons, and official Japanese retail details without overstating physical ownership of unowned merchandise.</li>
				<li><strong>Deep Narrative Analysis</strong>: Beyond simple plot summaries, we explore overarching themes, psychological character growth, foreshadowing, and visual artistic nuance.</li>
				<li><strong>Multi-Media Coverage</strong>: From physical comic volumes and official digital releases to anime adaptations, soundtrack CDs, and collector figures, we cover the full spectrum of Japanese pop culture.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>Verification Standards &amp; Transparency</h3>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Official Edition &amp; Retail Sources</strong>: Bindings, page counts, and pricing references are checked against official publisher listings, Amazon Japan, and Rakuten Japan catalogs. Unowned collectibles are evaluated strictly on published specifications.</li>
				<li><strong>Regional Purchase Transparency</strong>: For readers outside Japan, we distinguish between physical editions that ship internationally via Amazon Japan and Amazon.co.jp Kindle digital titles (which may require a Japan-region Amazon account).</li>
				<li><strong>Updates, Disclosures &amp; Contact</strong>: Pages are updated as new Deluxe or Box Set editions release. Please review our <a href="/disclaimer/">Affiliate Disclaimer</a> and <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, or reach out via <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> for corrections.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>Explore the Vault</h3>
			<p>
				Dive into our growing collection of series analyses and English buyer guides sourced from official Japanese catalogs.
			</p>

			<div class="cta-box">
				<a href="/guide/" class="btn-archive">Read Collector Guides</a>
				<a href="/archive/" class="btn-contact">Explore All Reviews</a>
				<a href="/contact/" class="btn-contact">Get in Touch</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.profile-container {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: #334155;
	}
	.profile-hero {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.profile-image-box {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 100%;
		border-radius: 16px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
		background-color: #f8fafc;
		border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
	}
	.hero-img {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		max-height: 480px;
		object-fit: cover;
		display: block;
	}
	.img-caption {
		display: block;
		padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: #64748b;
		background: #f1f5f9;
		border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
	}
	.profile-content h2 {
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		color: #1e293b;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #8b5cf6;
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
	}
	.profile-content h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: #334155;
		margin-top: 1.8rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
	}
	.profile-content p {
		margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
	}
	.profile-content ul {
		background-color: #f8fafc;
		border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.profile-content li {
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
	}
	.profile-content li:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.cta-box {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.btn-archive, .btn-contact {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}
	.btn-archive {
		background-color: #8b5cf6;
		color: #ffffff !important;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
	}
	.btn-archive:hover {
		background-color: #7c3aed;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}
	.btn-contact {
		background-color: #f1f5f9;
		color: #475569 !important;
		border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
	}
	.btn-contact:hover {
		background-color: #e2e8f0;
		color: #1e293b !important;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}
</style>
